":"Lamanā."}]},{"en":"And when three hundred and eighty and four years had passed away, we had gathered in all the remainder of our people unto the land of Cumorah.","n":5,"sm":"Ma e mavae atu le toluselau valusefulu ma le fa o tausaga ua matou faapotopotoina faatasi o matou tagata uma na totoe i le laueleele o Kumora.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"passed away","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"toluselau"},{"en":"the three hundred and eighty","sm":"valusefulu"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"the","sm":"le"},{"en":"four","sm":"fa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"years","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapotopotoina"},{"en":"we had gathered together","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"all our people","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"remainder","sm":"totoe"},{"en":"to","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the land","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Cumorah,","sm":"Kumora."}]},{"en":"And it came to pass that when we had gathered in all our people in one to the land of Cumorah, behold I, Mormon, began to be old; and knowing it to be the last struggle of my people, and having been commanded of the Lord that I should not suffer the records which had been handed down by our fathers, which were sacred, to fall into the hands of the Lamanites, (for the Lamanites would destroy them) therefore I made this record out of the plates of Nephi, and hid up in the hill Cumorah all the records which had been entrusted to me by the hand of the Lord, save it were these few plates which I gave unto my son Moroni.","n":6,"sm":"Ma sa oo ina ua uma ona matou faapotopoto faatasi o matou tagata uma i le laueleele o Kumora, faauta, o a’u, o Mamona, sa amata ona ou toeaina; ma i lo’u iloa o le tauiviga faaiu lea a lo’u nuu, ma ina ua poloaiina a’u e le Alii ia ou le tuuina talafaamaumau ia na tuulima faasolo mai e o ma